  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the rights of 125 children to education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2000,  BASICS has been committed to its mission in Ghana by protecting the basic human rights of children to education, shelter, food and safety.    We aid women and children living in unsafe environments and engaging in harmful activities (illiteracy, child labor, trafficking, child marriage, teenage pregnancy to school dropouts) which hinders their overall health, well-being and developmental growth.  Our programs provide access to education, skills and opportunities to empower.</narrative>
  </description>
